# Sequelize, "new tables come from init() — no migration") which contradicts database.md.
# workflow.md: "Do not commit secrets, client names or NDA-covered code into shared repos."
.claude/skills/jira/
.claude/agents/bugFixAgent.md
.claude/agents/jira-spec-implementer.md
